{"key":"light-after-darkness","title":"Light after Darkness","desc":"Light after Darkness: a free Dasara maze game for Navratri Day 7 by World of Wonders Studio. Carry a little lamp through a dark maze, keep it burning with ghee, slip past the shadows and reach Maa Kalaratri. English, Hindi and Kannada.","day_en":"Dasara · Day 7 game","yt":{"hi":"O5hzHeRdcuk","kn":"UdkvXp0aGn4"},"back":"ds-d7","aria":"A dark maze. You carry a small lamp that lights only the paths near you. Move with the arrow buttons, arrow keys or by swiping, collect ghee to keep the lamp bright, and reach Maa Kalaratri's glow.","hud":"<span>🪔 <i id=\"t-lvl\">Maze</i> <b id=\"lvl\">1</b>/5</span><span>❤️ <b id=\"lives\">3</b></span><span>🫙 <b id=\"ghee\">0</b></span><span>⭐ <b id=\"score\">0</b></span>","css":"canvas.st{height:clamp(440px,68vh,740px);touch-action:none}.pad{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,52px);grid-template-rows:repeat(2,52px);gap:6px}.pad button{border:2px solid #ffd35a88;background:#1c1442cc;color:#ffd35a;border-radius:14px;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer}.pad button:active{background:#f6a723;color:#1c1442}.pad .u{grid-column:2}.pad .l{grid-column:1;grid-row:2}.pad .d{grid-column:2;grid-row:2}.pad .r{grid-column:3;grid-row:2}","stage_extra":"<div class=\"pad\" aria-label=\"Move\"><button class=\"u\" data-d=\"0,-1\" aria-label=\"Up\">▲</button><button class=\"l\" data-d=\"-1,0\" aria-label=\"Left\">◀</button><button class=\"d\" data-d=\"0,1\" aria-label=\"Down\">▼</button><button class=\"r\" data-d=\"1,0\" aria-label=\"Right\">▶</button></div>"}
